    },
    {
      "name": "Top Navigation",
      "role": "Primary site navigation",
      "description": "White background, 1px bottom Hairline #d9d9d9 border, height ~64px. Left: Juicebox wordmark (Obsidian). Center: nav items (FEATURES, PRICING, RESOURCES, CUSTOMERS) in Haas Grot 14px Smoke, each with a 6px dropdown caret. Right: SIGN IN text link, BOOK A DEMO Outlined Ghost Button, TRY FOR FREE Filled Dark CTA. Logo, nav, and actions share one horizontal row with 24–40px gaps."
